WEBVTT

00:04:30.396 --> 00:04:33.436
They also promised
to leverage their influence

00:04:33.476 --> 00:04:37.476
to achieve the same in all the fields
where they’re a non-operator.

00:04:38.116 --> 00:04:39.916
They have never done that before.

00:04:39.956 --> 00:04:42.236
And to me, that was a significant step.

00:04:43.796 --> 00:04:45.876
How are we going to do that?

00:04:45.916 --> 00:04:49.796
Eliminating methane emissions,
slashing flaring,

00:04:49.836 --> 00:04:52.276
electrifying operations.

00:04:52.276 --> 00:04:54.956
In a bit longer, distant future,

00:04:54.996 --> 00:04:57.876
we will need to use hydrogen
in our own operations,

00:04:57.916 --> 00:05:00.836
carbon capture and storage
and other solutions.